- `buy` function: `uint256 token_amount = (swapValue * _balances[address(this)]) / (address(this).balance);` This uses the contract's token balance as reserve. But note: The contract's token balance includes tokens that are not part of liquidity? All tokens are initially in contract. When users buy, tokens are transferred out. When users sell, half tokens are transferred to contract, half burned. So contract's token balance changes. This is the reserve.

